Kuali substantially modified the upstream approach: Vexa services, API keys,
telemetry, bot management, transcript UI, recording upload, and YouTube support
were removed; the extension was renamed and redesigned around Kuali's local
WebSocket, per-frame channel namespaces, participant ID/name/avatar bindings,
and explicit separate-versus-mixed audio semantics.

The Kuali name and artwork belong to the Kuali project. Vexa names and artwork
are not bundled with this extension.
